    para('Signal correlation does not establish absolute timing accuracy: slip, mounting, derivative filters and shape mismatch can mimic changing lag. Widths of the correlation objective are flatness diagnostics, not statistical confidence intervals. C3D-assisted alignment is offline evaluation synchronization; C3D is unavailable to a deployed predictor.')
